// Golden dataset. One JSON object per line. Blank lines and // comments are ignored.
// Expectations point at PAGES, not chunk ids — pages survive re-chunking, so the same
// dataset scores every chunk-size ablation in Phase 2.
//
// Rules that keep this honest (see docs/EVALUATION.md):
//   1. Write questions FROM the documents, before running the system.
//   2. Include unanswerable questions, or refusal cannot be measured.
//   3. Include questions the system currently FAILS — those are the valuable ones.
//   4. Target 100+. Below ~50 the metrics move on noise.
{"id": "q-001", "question": "How do I create a database in MySQL?", "source": "MySQL Handbook.pdf", "expected_pages": [5], "expected_answer": "CREATE DATABASE startersql;", "tags": ["mysql", "rare-term"], "note": "Failed under dense retrieval at chunk_size 512: the term appears once in 47k chars and lost to topically similar 'Create a User' pages. Fixed by reducing chunk_size to 200, not by hybrid retrieval."}
{"id": "q-002", "question": "How do I create an index in MySQL?", "source": "MySQL Handbook.pdf", "expected_pages": [64], "expected_answer": "CREATE INDEX idx_email ON users(email);", "tags": ["mysql"], "note": "Passes. Dense score 0.755 at chunk_size 200."}
{"id": "q-003", "question": "What are De Morgan's laws?", "source": "Anirudh_Arora_Practical_File.pdf", "expected_pages": [7], "expected_answer": "(A u B u C)' = A' n B' n C' and (A n B n C)' = A' u B' u C'", "tags": ["discrete-maths"], "note": "Passes at chunk_size 200. Failed at 512, where page 7 content was absorbed into a chunk starting on page 5."}
