{"id": "q-008", "question": "What is Experiment 1 in the OOP lab file?", "source": "OOP_Lab_Practical_File_Anirudh_Arora_2581258.pdf", "expected_pages": [2], "expected_answer": "Experiment 1(a): Array Operations", "tags": ["java", "navigational", "known-failure"], "note": "Fails under dense, BM25, and hybrid retrieval. Predicted BM25 would fix it; it did not. BM25 scores terms independently, so 'Experiment 1' matches 'Experiment 3' plus any stray '1' equally well, and length normalisation then favours short chunks. Query stopword removal (9 tokens to 5) also changed nothing. Needs phrase or proximity matching, which neither retriever provides."}
